 104:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Asclin/Spi/IfxAsclin_Spi.c **** IfxAsclin_Spi_Status IfxAsclin_Spi_getStatus(IfxAsclin_Spi *asclin)
 105:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Asclin/Spi/IfxAsclin_Spi.c **** {
 106:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Asclin/Spi/IfxAsclin_Spi.c ****     IfxAsclin_Spi_Status status = IfxAsclin_Spi_Status_ok;
