 522:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * It cannot be used for this activity towards other CPUs.
 523:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API also clears the sticky overflow after the read. While reading the sticky bit this API d
 524:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * the counter for short time. (otherwise sticky bit cannot be cleared). This API shall be used aft
 525:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
